P. Dazwischen werden die Bewertungspunkte auf volle Punkte interpoliert."},{"field_id":"BT-541-Lot-WeightNumber","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":null,"value":10.0},{"code":"poi-exa","field_id":"BT-5421-Lot","list":"number-weight","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-734-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Wendekreisdurchmesser"}]},{"kind":"LotAwardCriterion","parent_section_id":"LOT-0000","section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterion#2","values":[{"code":"quality","field_id":"BT-539-Lot","list":"award-criterion-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-540-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Durchgangshöhe Beifahrertür in mm: # maximal erreichbar: 5 BP, # Aufgliederung wie folgt: höher 2.200 mm = 5 BP; höher 2.000 - 2.200 mm = 4 BP; höher 1.800 - 2.000 mm = 3 BP, höher/gleich 1.600 - 1.800 mm = 1 BP, kleiner 1.600 mm = Ausschluss"},{"field_id":"BT-541-Lot-WeightNumber","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":null,"value":5.0},{"code":"poi-exa","field_id":"BT-5421-Lot","list":"number-weight","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-734-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Durchgangshöhe Beifahrertür"}]},{"kind":"LotAwardCriterion","parent_section_id":"LOT-0000","section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterion#3","values":[{"code":"quality","field_id":"BT-539-Lot","list":"award-criterion-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-540-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Breite der Beifahrersitzbank in mm: # maximal erreichbar: 5 BP, # Das Angebot mit der breitesten Sitzbank erhält 100% (= 5 BP) der Bewertungspunkte. Ein Angebot, dessen Sitzbankbreite 25% oder weniger unter dem mit der breitesten Sitzbank liegt, erhält 0 BP. Dazwischen werden die Bewertungspunkte auf volle Punkte interpoliert."},{"field_id":"BT-541-Lot-WeightNumber","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":null,"value":5.0},{"code":"poi-exa","field_id":"BT-5421-Lot","list":"number-weight","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-734-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Breite der Beifahrersitzbank"}]},{"kind":"LotAwardCriterion","parent_section_id":"LOT-0000","section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterion#4","values":[{"code":"quality","field_id":"BT-539-Lot","list":"award-criterion-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-540-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Überhang Heckteil in mm: # maximal erreichbar: 5 BP. # Das Angebot mit geringsten Überhang erhält 100% (= 5 BP) der Bewertungspunkte. Ein Angebot, dessen Überhang 20% oder mehr über dem mit dem geringsten Überhang liegt, erhält 0 BP. Dazwischen werden die Bewertungspunkte auf volle Punkte interpoliert."},{"field_id":"BT-541-Lot-WeightNumber","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":null,"value":5.0},{"code":"poi-exa","field_id":"BT-5421-Lot","list":"number-weight","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-734-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Überhang Heckteil"}]},{"kind":"LotAwardCriterion","parent_section_id":"LOT-0000","section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterion#5","values":[{"code":"quality","field_id":"BT-539-Lot","list":"award-criterion-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-540-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Lieferzeit in Wochen: # maximal erreichbar: 10 BP. # Das Angebot mit der kürzesten Lieferzeit erhält 10 BP. # Je 2 volle Wochen längere Lieferzeit erhält der Bieter 1 BP weniger. # Beispiel: - Lieferzeit Bieter (A): 20 Wochen: = 10 BP, - Lieferzeit Bieter (B): 22 Wochen: = 9 BP, - Lieferzeit Bieter (C): 25 Wochen: = 8 BP."},{"field_id":"BT-541-Lot-WeightNumber","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":null,"value":10.0},{"code":"poi-exa","field_id":"BT-5421-Lot","list":"number-weight","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-734-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Lieferzeit"}]},{"kind":"LotAwardCriterion","parent_section_id":"LOT-0000","section_id":"ND-LotAwardCriterion#6","values":[{"code":"quality","field_id":"BT-539-Lot","list":"award-criterion-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-540-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Dauer Vollgarantie in Monaten: # maximal erreichbar: 15 BP, # Aufgliederung wie folgt: größer/gleich 48 Monate = 15 BP; von 36 - 47 Monate = 10 BP, von 24 - 35 Monate = 5 BP, kleiner 24 Monate = Ausschluss"},{"field_id":"BT-541-Lot-WeightNumber","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":null,"value":15.0},{"code":"poi-exa","field_id":"BT-5421-Lot","list":"number-weight","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-734-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Dauer Vollgarantie"}]},{"kind":"LotPlacePerformance","parent_section_id":"LOT-0000","section_id":"ND-LotPlacePerformance#0","values":[{"code":"DE91C","field_id":"BT-5071-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"nuts","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"BT-5121-Lot","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"37079"},{"field_id":"BT-5131-Lot","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Göttingen"},{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-5141-Lot","list":"country","ordinal":0,"type":"code"}]},{"kind":"LotPreviousPlanning","parent_section_id":"LOT-0000","section_id":"ND-LotPreviousPlanning#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-125(i)-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"604435-2026"}]},{"kind":"LotResultContractReference","parent_section_id":"RES-0001","section_id":"ND-LotResultContractReference#0","values":[{"field_id":"OPT-315-LotResult","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"contract","type":"id","value":"CON-0001"}]},{"kind":"LotResultTenderReference","parent_section_id":"RES-0001","section_id":"ND-LotResultTenderReference#0","values":[{"field_id":"OPT-320-LotResult","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"tender","type":"id","value":"TEN-0001"}]},{"kind":"OrganizationUboReference","parent_section_id":"ORG-9000","section_id":"ND-OrganizationUboReference#0","values":[{"field_id":"OPT-302-Organization","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"ubo","type":"id","value":"UBO-0001"}]},{"kind":"PreviousNoticeReference","parent_sect